<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100574" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνθε-άομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>view</i> or <i>see together</i>, of spectators at
			games, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>La.</u>
				178a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				3.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ συνθεώμενοι</span> the
				<i>other spectators</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				3.4.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>examine together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἱερά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					6.4.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὰ κατὰ τὴν μοῦσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					967e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>take in at a glance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.25.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.40.7
			</span></i>.</div>
